# Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/           App.tsx, main.tsx, global CSS
├── features/      Domain modules
│   └── users/     Primary CRUD template — copy this for new resources
│       ├── api/   TanStack Query hooks (useUsersList, mutations)
│       └── pages/ List page, form modal, ColumnDefs, validationSchema
└── shared/
    ├── components/  UI primitives + GenericDataGrid
    ├── hooks/       useTableState, useTheme, useDisclosure
    ├── services/    axios, echo, queryClient
    ├── i18n/        en.ts + ar.ts
    └── layouts/     Layout, Sidebar, Header
```

## Adding a feature

1. Copy `src/features/users/` structure
2. Add API hooks calling Laravel resource routes
3. Wire route in `App.tsx` and nav in `Sidebar.tsx`
4. Add i18n keys to **both** `en.ts` and `ar.ts`
